completion still need a P18-V01 API/flow disposition. Documentation-only change;
no tests were run. Broad P18-V01 remains open.

2026-10-15 21:45 UTC — closed the request/reply producer-unregister disposition
from the Phase 15 matrix. Pinned Java `MQClientInstance.unregisterProducer`
removes the producer table entry and unregisters it with brokers; it does not
remove entries from `RequestFutureHolder.getRequestFutureTable()`. Rust
lease-based unregister previously removed that producer's pending correlations
and returned `ProducerShutdown`, unlike Java and the existing group-based Rust
path. Lease unregister now preserves correlations so late replies still
complete them. Request-future drop cancellation maps to Java's synchronous
request `finally` cleanup after interruption; direct `control.cancel` maps to
removal from Java's public live correlation table. Updated the Phase 15 matrix
and release checklist; broad P18-V01 remains open.

